### Traer todas las aulas
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms

### ---

### Crear aula
POST http://localhost:3000/classrooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aula 101",
  "code": "A101",
  "description": "Laboratorio de Programación"
}

### ---

### Obtener aula por codigo
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms/A101

### ---

### Eliminar aula por codigo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/classrooms/A101